{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303115","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303115","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430311501:1":{"text":"맞아... 믿을 수 없어. 우리가 은혜의 이슬이라고 믿었던 게 드래곤의 알 에센스였다니...","source_cn":"是的……不敢相信，我们一直以来以为的恩典灵露竟然是龙蛋清……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4320121E37F6614F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430311502:1":{"text":"드래곤화된 얼굴을 가리기 위해서 쓴 베일도 여왕의 비밀을 감추기 위해 이용당한 거였어!","source_cn":"而我们用遮面去遮挡脸上的龙化，竟然是在帮女王掩藏这个秘密！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5175B392E668C260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430311503:1":{"text":"여왕은 우리를 속였을 뿐만 아니라 비밀을 완벽히 숨기기 위해 우리를 이용한 거야...","source_cn":"她不但欺骗了我们，还利用我们，将秘密掩藏的更好更深……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDBF1EF9E2CAAA3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族法芙":{"text":"귀족 파프","source":"贵族法芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族恩特":{"text":"귀족 언트","source":"贵族恩特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}